{"reviews":[{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-0","r":4.0,"t":"I can finally way my masks comfortably!","x":"I have to wear a mask all day long in my job.  I feel like I can't breathe often.  The mask makes me feel overheated and uncomfortable in my inability to breathe correctly.  I bought a package of these, and I no longer feel any of that!  I can breathe freely and still wear my necessary mask.  Love it!  \u2764","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-1","r":4.0,"t":"Nice","x":"I received these and they are amazing. I love that these silicone inserts help make wearing a mask more comfortable and they allow me to breathe easier. Holds the 2 face masks- one paper with cloth over it together and easier to put on my face quickly. I am not sucking in my face mask anymore when I breathe if I am outside walking or working. I like the fact that it will attach to your mask, so it does not fall out when you remove your mask. It helps you to breathe better. like that this bracket","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-2","r":5.0,"t":"Does not slip and comfortable","x":"I love my face mask bracket. I have recommended it to many people. I struggled to breath with a face mask because I have asthma which also puts me in a high risk category. I stopped going for walks because I just couldn\u2019t breath until I got this mask bracket. It does not slip, it allows me to breath and it helps to not fog up my glasses. It is comfortable and a great deal for 3 of them. I would definitely buy again but I don\u2019t think that I will have to because it will last a long time. You get u","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-3","r":1.0,"t":"Just won\u2019t work for me","x":"I haven\u2019t put these to a full test and probably won\u2019t.  I should have realized that the silicone will probably make me sweat.  But, if also just doesn\u2019t fit right. To get it comfortable on my nose, the bottom lands just below my lip. To get it comfortable on my chin, it moves all over at the top because it\u2019s not on my nose. I checked the pictures again and it seems I should have a better fit.  I bought these to avoid my glasses fogging up. I found anti-fog lens wipes that will help much more tha","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-4","r":1.0,"t":"Zero \ud83c\udf1f","x":"The silicon does not hold its shape and gets stuck to my nose and cheeks leaving marks. It has a piece that goes over bridge of nose. Making it extremely uncomfortable and painful. Couldn't wear it more than 20 min.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-5","r":1.0,"t":"Its an ok product","x":"They are cold when first put on and since i have to wear a mask for 8 hours a day it does get warm. It also slips down after wearing about an hour","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-6","r":5.0,"t":"Works as expected","x":"These are better than other \"soft\" mask inserts I've purchased.  More comfortable to wear and does help with minimizing fogging up of sunglasses","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-7","r":5.0,"t":"Soft and comfortable","x":"I bought these for my kids to wear under their masks at school. I wasn't sure at first, but after having my kids try them on under their mask, I know this was a good purchase. It holds the mask away from their nose and mouth making it easier to breath. It is soft and easy to use with your mask. I feel like these are going to make all the difference in their days. Definitely would recommend if you have to wear a mask all day!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-8","r":5.0,"t":"This works!","x":"I needed something to keep my mask off my mouth as I suffer from cold sores. This one works. Best of all it stays comfortably in place. I do find it gets a little warm thought because the silicone is a thicker grade. A small price to pay for its ease of use. I like how easy it cleans up too.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-9","r":4.0,"t":"Most comfortable bracket yet","x":"Harder bracket hurt my nose.  These are soft and keep the mask off my face.  It does stick to my face once I\u2019ve had it on for a while, but since I do not wear it longer than a few hours at a time, I am overall happy with its comfort.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-10","r":3.0,"t":"Good quality but poor comfort!","x":"I always run on the hotter side and I have extremely sensitive skin. I have no problems with this product before I start to sweat. However once I begin to sweat the silicone is extremely uncomfortable/irritating on my skin.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-11","r":2.0,"t":"Not comfortable, discolored quickly.","x":"These made my face even sweatier, and the white one turned a yellowish tint after wearing for 2 days.  I don't wear foundation, so it's not like it's just makeup rubbing off.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-12","r":5.0,"t":"Comfortable, easy-to-use, and I can breathe!","x":"I picked this item because it had the shape I wanted, as well as the side connectors (so the whole thing wasn't just floating inside my mask). Highly recommend.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-13","r":5.0,"t":"Soft, comfortable","x":"Love that these are soft, not hard plastic. Allows me to breathe better & helps with my glasses not fogging. They still occasionally fog but not near as bad.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-14","r":2.0,"t":"Hard to adjust and keep it on.","x":"Yes it is very soft and pliable, but maybe because of it, it didn't fit my face right.  The side slits were difficult to use with various masks.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-15","r":5.0,"t":"Keep the mask off your lips","x":"Works great and easier to breathe. Keeps the sunglasses from fogging up. The customer service is top notch as well. Highly recommend this item.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-16","r":2.0,"t":"Stick to Face","x":"I love the idea of these. However, in reality they do not fit all masks. And worst they stick to your face and make you sweat. Disappointed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-17","r":2.0,"t":"Useful","x":"Like the idea but it does slide down. It also gets sweaty. Works ok for the gym. Easy to clean and sanitize.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-18","r":2.0,"t":"Too flimsy","x":"This product is flimsy and does not sit on the face on secure the mask properly. Very uncomfortable","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-19","r":4.0,"t":"Makes it much easier to breath","x":"light and flexalbe -- comfortable to wear and makes breathing through a mask much easier","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-20","r":1.0,"t":"Don't fit","x":"I've tried to use this on several different sized masks and they don't fit on any","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-21","r":1.0,"t":"Poor quality","x":"My items arrived misshapen and poorly made. This is not a good item to purchase.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-22","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent","x":"These are very comfortable, soft, flexible washable and reusable.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-23","r":1.0,"t":"I didn\u2019t recommend this!","x":"Sticks to your face and moves around.  Very uncomfortable!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08QVHDDSZ-24","r":3.0,"t":"It works! Mostly...","x":"I had to bump this from 4 to 3 stars.  After working a 12 hr shift they left something to be desired.  They mostly work but there were a few issues with fogging.  Still better with than without.  *** Original Review:  I'm practically blind without my glasses. And foggy lenses from having to wear a mask is almost as bad as not wearing my glasses.  I wasn't very hopeful for these mask inserts but to my surprise they actually seem to work!  As long as I don't go jogging in them.  I did a test by bl","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say the insert makes it easier to breathe while wearing a mask.","cites":[1,2,3,8,13,14]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the silicone as soft and comfortable.","cites":[2,3,7,8,10,13,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the silicone gets warm or sweaty and can stick to or irritate the skin.","cites":[4,6,9,10,11,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers say it does not fit their face well or slips out of place.","cites":[4,5,6,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention it helps reduce fogging of glasses.","cites":[7,14]}]},"qa":[]}